#### \`onDisconnectMessage(payload)\`



**Example (JavaScript):**
\`\`\`javascript
client.onDisconnectMessage({
  \\"type\\": \\"disconnect\\",
  \\"reason\\": \\"warning\\",
  \\"debug_info\\": {
    \\"host\\": \\"applink-0\\"
  }
})
\`\`\`


**Example (Python):**
\`\`\`python
client.on_disconnect_message({
  \\"type\\": \\"disconnect\\",
  \\"reason\\": \\"warning\\",
  \\"debug_info\\": {
    \\"host\\": \\"applink-0\\"
  }
})
\`\`\`


**Example (JavaScript):**
\`\`\`javascript
client.onDisconnectMessage({
  \\"type\\": \\"disconnect\\",
  \\"reason\\": \\"refresh_requested\\",
